; Tabitha, sketch C "Pigtail Funk": F# minor, 118 bpm. A plucked-guitar riff in syncopated sixteenths answered by offbeat brass stabs over a busy plucked bass and a funk kit. Original notes, AW2 voices, no rom lines.
song tabitha_c
tempo 118
meter 4/4
reverb 173
priority 0

inst pluck = A.27 shift=12
inst brass = A.111 shift=-12
inst bass = A.34 shift=24
inst kit = A.120
hit kick=36 rim=37 clap=39 snare=40 hat=44 ohat=46 tom1=45 tom2=48 tom3=50 crash=49

